      "customData": {
        "section": "8-cost",
        "anchor": [
          1750,
          7594.3,
          "lt"
        ]
      },
      "text": "bytes, not time: the ring takes 2(N − 1) steps\none after another, and every step pays latency.\nbig gradients: bandwidth wins. small messages:\nthe hops win, which is why NCCL also has trees",
      "originalText": "bytes, not time: the ring takes 2(N − 1) steps\none after another, and every step pays latency.\nbig gradients: bandwidth wins. small messages:\nthe hops win, which is why NCCL also has trees",
